        "internal/pluginhost/voiceaudio.go OpenWithAudio, allocateInputStream, audioOpenArgs: output_handle, input_handle, the audio object, audio.input.stream, and the roles and the report moved under audio.input; audio.input null and no input_handle for a binding with no input",
